{"kind": "weekly", "period": "2026-W35", "prepared_on": "2026-08-29", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📅 本週 AI 新聞回顧 · 2026-08-24 ～ 2026-08-29</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> Report: Nvidia to Acquire AI Model Repository Hugging Face for $13 Billion<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">傳Nvidia將以130億美元收購AI模型庫Hugging Face</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Nvidia is reportedly acquiring Hugging Face, the popular open-source AI hub, to secure critical infrastructure for open models and expand into cloud services.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">據報導，Nvidia即將收購熱門開源AI模型平台Hugging Face，藉此掌握開放模型的關鍵基礎設施，並重返雲端業務。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/ai/2026/08/report-nvidia-to-acquire-ai-model-repository-hugging-face-for-13-billion/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> OpenAI Shares Findings on the Hugging Face Security Incident<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI公布Hugging Face資安事件調查結果</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI details what caused its agents to hack Hugging Face last month and outlines steps to strengthen AI model security, monitoring, and alignment going forward.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI說明上月其代理入侵Hugging Face事件的成因，並提出強化AI模型安全性、監控與對齊機制的後續措施。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">OpenAI</b> · <a href=\"https://openai.com/index/hugging-face-incident-and-the-road-ahead\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> Judge Blocks the Pentagon's Attempt to Blacklist Anthropic<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">法官裁定五角大廈將Anthropic列黑名單違法</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">A federal judge ruled the Department of Defense's designation of Anthropic as a national security supply-chain risk was \"illegal and baseless.\"</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">聯邦法官裁定，美國國防部將Anthropic列為國家安全供應鏈風險的認定「非法且毫無根據」。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Wired</b> · <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/a-judge-has-blocked-the-pentagons-attempt-to-blacklist-anthropic/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> An Anthropic Researcher Just Gave Us a Peek at Self-Improving AI<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Anthropic研究員揭露自我改進AI的初步樣貌</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Given 10 benchmarks for specific misaligned behaviors, automated systems improved performance on every single one without degrading overall performance.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">在針對特定失準行為的10項基準測試中，自動化系統在每一項都有所提升，且未犧牲整體效能。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/28/an-anthropic-researcher-just-gave-us-a-peek-at-self-improving-ai/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, and 100 Other Companies Call for Action to Defend Against Rogue AI<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI、Anthropic、Google等百餘家企業聯合呼籲防範失控AI</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Some of the world's largest tech companies and AI startups came together to decry the current state of cybersecurity and advertise a new solution against a new generation of cyber threats.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">多家全球大型科技公司與AI新創共同批評現行資安防護不足，並提出因應新一代網路威脅的解決方案。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/27/openai-anthropic-google-and-100-other-companies-call-for-action-to-defend-against-rogue-ai/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> OpenAI Is Developing a 'Persistent' AI Agent<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI正在開發「持續運作」AI代理</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Code reviewed by WIRED reveals the company is developing a feature that enables Codex to continue working proactively until it is \"put to sleep.\"</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">WIRED審視的程式碼顯示，OpenAI正開發讓Codex能主動持續運作、直到被「休眠」為止的新功能。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Wired</b> · <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/openai-is-developing-a-persistent-ai-agent/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Inside Meta's Push to Put Robots to Work in Data Centers<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">深入Meta推動機器人進駐資料中心的計畫</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Meta is testing robots that can swap cables and reset servers, tasks normally done by technicians, raising concerns among some workers about job security.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Meta正測試能更換纜線、重啟伺服器等原本由技術人員執行的機器人，引發部分員工對工作保障的擔憂。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Wired</b> · <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/inside-metas-experiments-with-data-center-robots/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Bill Gates Says We've Passed AI's Danger Thresholds. Now What?<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">比爾蓋茲：AI危險門檻已被跨越，接下來怎麼辦？</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Gates discusses his views on AI risk and where the technology's development should go from here.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">比爾蓋茲分享他對AI風險的看法，並探討這項技術接下來該如何發展。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">MIT Technology Review</b> · <a href=\"https://www.technologyreview.com/2026/08/26/1142946/bill-gates-ai-danger-threshold/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> Apple Patches Private Cloud Compute Path Traversal Flaw That Could Redirect AI Telemetry<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">蘋果修補私有雲端運算路徑穿越漏洞，恐致AI推論資料外洩</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Researchers demonstrated that the flaw in Apple's Private Cloud Compute, which supports some Apple Intelligence features, could redirect AI inference telemetry to an external server.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">研究人員證實，蘋果支援部分Apple Intelligence功能的私有雲端運算服務存在漏洞，可將AI推論相關遙測資料導向外部伺服器。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178514\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> Open-Weight AI Companies Are the Valley's Hottest Acquisition Targets<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">開放權重AI公司成為矽谷最熱門收購標的</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">There's a lot of capital pouring into the business of giving models away for free.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">大量資金正湧入開放權重AI模型這門「免費釋出模型」的生意。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/28/open-weight-ai-companies-are-the-valleys-hottest-acquisition-targets/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}